@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route118_Text_PerryIntro
Hoenn_Route118_Text_PerryIntro::
	.string "BIRD POKéMON that FLY elegantly in\n"
	.string "the sky… They're the best!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route118_Text_PerryDefeat
Hoenn_Route118_Text_PerryDefeat::
	.string "Urgh…\n"
	.string "I crashed…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route118_Text_PerryPostBattle
Hoenn_Route118_Text_PerryPostBattle::
	.string "You've got great POKéMON.\n"
	.string "I'll have to train mine better.$"

@ pokeemerald data/maps/Route118/scripts.inc: Route118_Text_CanCrossRiversWithSurf
Hoenn_Route118_Text_CanCrossRiversWithSurf::
	.string "Even if there isn't a boat, you can\n"
	.string "cross rivers and the sea if you have\l"
	.string "a POKéMON that knows SURF.\p"
	.string "POKéMON can be counted on to do so\n"
	.string "much!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route118_Text_RoseIntro
Hoenn_Route118_Text_RoseIntro::
	.string "The aroma of flowers has a magical\n"
	.string "power. It cleanses us body and soul.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route118_Text_RoseDefeat
Hoenn_Route118_Text_RoseDefeat::
	.string "Oh, dear me.\n"
	.string "I seem to have lost.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route118_Text_RosePostBattle
Hoenn_Route118_Text_RosePostBattle::
	.string "Flowers, POKéMON…\n"
	.string "I love whatever smells nice.\p"
	.string "Stinky things…\n"
	.string "I'll pass.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route118_Text_WadeIntro
Hoenn_Route118_Text_WadeIntro::
	.string "For FISHERMEN, equipment is the key.\p"
	.string "But for TRAINERS, the key ingredients\n"
	.string "are POKéMON and heart, of course!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route118_Text_WadeDefeat
Hoenn_Route118_Text_WadeDefeat::
	.string "I was beaten in heart?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route118_Text_WadePostBattle
Hoenn_Route118_Text_WadePostBattle::
	.string "Come to think of it, fishing is a battle\n"
	.string "between a FISHERMAN and a POKéMON.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route118_Text_ChesterIntro
Hoenn_Route118_Text_ChesterIntro::
	.string "Take flight!\n"
	.string "My BIRD POKéMON!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route118_Text_ChesterDefeat
Hoenn_Route118_Text_ChesterDefeat::
	.string "They did take flight…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route118_Text_ChesterPostBattle
Hoenn_Route118_Text_ChesterPostBattle::
	.string "If they'd get stronger, they'd be able\n"
	.string "to fly more freely…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route118_Text_BarnyIntro
Hoenn_Route118_Text_BarnyIntro::
	.string "I'm a FISHERMAN, but also a TRAINER.\n"
	.string "I'm raising the POKéMON I caught.$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route118_Text_BarnyDefeat
Hoenn_Route118_Text_BarnyDefeat::
	.string "I thought I was doing okay in my\n"
	.string "training…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route118_Text_BarnyPostBattle
Hoenn_Route118_Text_BarnyPostBattle::
	.string "I couldn't win by training POKéMON\n"
	.string "while I fished…\p"
	.string "Was I doing things in half measures?$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route118_Text_DaltonIntro
Hoenn_Route118_Text_DaltonIntro::
	.string "Let my melody rock your soul!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route118_Text_DaltonDefeat
Hoenn_Route118_Text_DaltonDefeat::
	.string "La-lalala…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route118_Text_DaltonPostBattle
Hoenn_Route118_Text_DaltonPostBattle::
	.string "An electric guitar doesn't always\n"
	.string "have to be noisy…\p"
	.string "It can be strummed to squeeze out\n"
	.string "this heart-stirring melody…$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route118_Text_DeandreIntro
Hoenn_Route118_Text_DeandreIntro::
	.string "Go, go, go!\n"
	.string "POKéMON 1, 2, and 3!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route118_Text_DeandreDefeat
Hoenn_Route118_Text_DeandreDefeat::
	.string "Come in, POKéMON! Are you okay?\n"
	.string "POKéMON 1, 2, and 3?!$"

@ pokeemerald data/text/trainers.inc: Route118_Text_DeandrePostBattle
Hoenn_Route118_Text_DeandrePostBattle::
	.string "Isn't it cool that I have a POKéMON\n"
	.string "battle team?\p"
	.string "You can copy me--I don't mind!$"

